{"comment":"The setup: the fixture app with Always Allow, the instance main:1 of the tool window, the process up, and one ticket for main:1."}
{"step":"file","path":"${home}/.air/apps/fixture.yaml","text":"format: 1\nid: fixture\nname: Fixture\nserver:\n  command: ${dir}/fixture-app\n  args: [serve]\nviews:\n  main: { resource: ui://fixture/main, place: toolWindow, toolWindow: { title: Fixture, titleActions: [refresh] } }\n  log: { resource: ui://fixture/log, place: toolWindowTab, toolWindowTab: { of: main, title: Log } }\n  review: { resource: ui://fixture/review, place: editor, instances: many }\n  settings: { resource: ui://fixture/settings, place: window, window: { width: 880, height: 640 } }\nactions:\n  - id: refresh\n    text: Refresh Fixture\n    icon: AllIcons.Actions.Refresh\n    groups: [Vcs.MainMenu]\n    run: { tool: refresh }\n"}
